== Redmine Tags plugin changelog

Redmine Tags plugin - Tags board plugin for redmine
Copyright (C) 2011-2026 Kirill Bezrukov (RedmineUP)
http://www.redmineup.com/

== 2026-08-15 v0.0.3

Release: remaining logic + permissions (tag_filter UI, visibility UI)
Target: Redmine 7.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
Plugin ID: :redmineup_tags

Form & visibility
* UI for visibility: all / owner / roles (radio)
* Roles multi-select when visibility=roles; validation requires ≥1 role
* Owner auto-assigned to current user when visibility=owner
* UI for tag_filter: whitelist of project tags; empty whitelist ⇒ empty cloud
* Settings table shows visibility summary column
* Locales EN/RU for all new labels and permission help text

Permissions
* manage_tag_clouds (require: :member) — CRUD + reorder
* select_tag_clouds — personal sidebar visibility modal
* Cloud-level visibility rule applied in visible_for? before preference override
* Documented in settings info text

Logic
* Controller syncs role_ids / tag_ids on create/update; clears when not applicable
* Model assigned_role_ids / assigned_tag_ids work for new records before save
* Unit tests for owner, roles, tag_filter, uniqueness, preferences

Not in this release
* V.0.0.4 full automated functional suite / exhaustive manual matrix only

== 2026-08-10 v0.0.2-beta

Release tag: v0.0.2-beta
Target: Redmine 7.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
Plugin ID: :redmineup_tags (compatibility with RedmineUP Q&A and other tag plugins)

Schema & models
* Force-rebuild multi-project schema (tag_clouds, tag_cloud_projects, tag_cloud_tags, tag_cloud_roles, tag_cloud_preferences)
* Tags/taggings preserved
* TagCloud without project_id / is_system / position; join models for project link and order
* Default Tags cloud is virtual (not stored in DB)
* visible_for? with visibility all|owner|roles + user preference override

Display & filtering
* TagCloudAggregator: real RedmineUP tags only; empty filters = all; include_subprojects; open_only from plugin settings
* Sidebar: system Tags + custom clouds ordered by tag_cloud_projects.position
* Settings: filters summary, create/edit filters, include_subprojects, visible_by_default
* Preferences modal: per-user visibility + drag order
* Default plugin settings: simple_cloud sidebar, show issue counts

Fixes
* Tag click links use Redmine f/op/v + set_filter so issue list applies immediately (no second Apply)
* Helpers on ProjectsController; plugin controllers declare helpers
* Locales EN/RU for multi tag clouds

Docs
* doc/TEST_DISPLAY_FILTERS.md — manual QA checklist
* doc/RELEASE_0.0.2-beta.md — release notes

